00:03:40.980 --> 00:03:45.560
The article traces the shift from early skepticism to the company's current valuation.

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:52.700
It also notes Straubel's subsequent work on Redwood materials, which now recycles battery materials

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:58.900
