00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:05.720
activity come into focus. Another longer wheelbase model Y, L, appeared on public roads in the United

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:11.540
States. Tesla launched the variant in China last year, where it quickly became popular for its

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:17.580
