00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:23.410
configurator without restriction. The repeated sighting suggests the company is actively evaluating

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:30.450
a North American introduction of the longer model Y. From product variants, ongoing cold weather

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:37.330
