00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:55.070
This capability addresses one of the longest standing concerns about heavy-duty electric trucks in

00:04:55.070 --> 00:05:02.030
northern climates. From semi-validation, smaller-scale owner incentives follow. Tesla is running a new

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:08.170
