00:05:20.390 --> 00:05:26.670
collection mechanic with a direct mileage prize. From customer programs, a quick note on media and

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:32.810
perception closes the week. Multiple recent crash reports did not name the vehicle make or model

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:38.870
in headlines or early paragraphs. The observation points to inconsistent media practices when

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:44.890
covering incidents involving different brands. Tesla vehicles often receive explicit branding in

00:05:44.890 --> 00:05:51.110
similar coverage. The pattern affects how readers initially perceive the story. Community discussion

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:57.830
on X centers on whether this omission changes the tone of reporting. Tesla also published a new patent

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:03.650
describing a molecular shield for dry electrode battery binders. The patent describes coating

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:09.310
PTFE binder particles with an ionically insulating yet electrically conductive layer before

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:15.470
fiberlization. Materials such as carbon black, graphene, or copper can form the shell through

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:21.490
mechanical fusion. The coating aims to prevent lithium ions and electrons from reducing the polymer

00:06:21.490 --> 00:06:27.650
and forming lithium fluoride. The process keeps the solvent-free dry electrode workflow intact

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:33.430
while addressing one chemical degradation path. An earlier analyst forecast had projected Tesla

00:06:33.430 --> 00:06:40.910
would deliver 392,900 vehicles in the second quarter. The estimate arrived amend ongoing production

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:46.010
at the three main vehicle factories. No breakdown by model was included in the projection.

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:50.790
